# African Childrens Choir Workshop

A grass roots exchange with the children of The African Children's Choir that will entertain adults and children alike. Grab this rare opportunity to get up close and personal with the choir learning Ugandan songs, drumming and dance. Having performed with celebrities such as Will Smith, Bob Geldorf, Alicia Keys and Annie Lennox, The African Children's Choir is excited to share a culturally intimate evening with you on its second tour of the eastern coast of Australia. This workshop is all about public participation - learn the songs, the dance moves, and the art of African drumming as the children invite you to share in their story. You will laugh, you may well cry, and you will be touched forever by the warmth and pure joy of these amazing children. Do you have any African drums? Bring them along - the more the merrier!
